On July 29, 2025 he was a campground host at Driftwood II, in the Siltcoos =
corridor of the Oregon Dunes National Recreation Area, four months after Or=
egon State Parks dismissed him. That afternoon he read an interview with th=
e director, and he wrote to her.
<a href=3D"https://oprdvolunteerabuse.org/record/oprd/01K1C14TXRFZCGXVNW27S=
ACRF4/" id=3D"OWA22e1941a-2749-612b-cf33-e5b4b310dc7b" class=3D"text-sky-80=
0 underline decoration-sky-300 underline-offset-2 hover:text-sky-600 OWAAut=
oLink">
I hope you are successful at finding an ethical and supportive way to keep =
our state parks going.</a> Then he told her he had been one of her voluntee=
rs from January through March, and that it had been deeply rewarding.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" id=3D"p261" class=
=3D"elementToProof">
Then he told her the truth of what had been done to him inside her institut=
ion. He asked her for nothing. He named the staff by their positions, told =
her the institution was hers and the people in it were her responsibility, =
and told her to sit with that. He
 was not appealing to her. He had not been part of her hierarchy since the =
day he was dismissed, and he wrote to her as one person telling another wha=
t her institution had done.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" id=3D"p262" class=
=3D"elementToProof">
He was a year into building <a href=3D"https://autonomyrealms.com" target=
=3D"_blank" id=3D"OWA865e5e37-04f0-b54f-7ad7-648a187e8378" class=3D"inline-=
flex items-baseline gap-1 text-emerald-800 underline decoration-emerald-300=
 hover:text-emerald-600 OWAAutoLink" rel=3D"noreferrer">
Autonomy Realms</a>. A person gets a realm of their own, and anything they =
have ever recorded goes into it as a signal: video, audio, photographs, doc=
uments, conversations, a journal page photographed off a shelf after twenty=
 years (<a href=3D"https://rswfire.com/library/signal/01KE0KY6HR09RFSFSEC7Z=
T1HAB?t=3D15" id=3D"OWA03c4c932-fe74-5679-2bcb-18e41fe3fb9d" class=3D"font-=
mono text-[0.9em] text-emerald-800 underline decoration-emerald-300 underli=
ne-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-600 OWAAutoLink" title=3D"Demonstrating the =
