FSEC7ZT1HAB" data-t=3D"15">0:15</a>),
 the route of a walk. The system does not summarise them. It reads each one=
 through several lenses at once, what happened and what it was and what it =
carries and what it says about the shape of the person, and one of those le=
nses is a mirror that hands him
 his own interior back in words he did not yet have for it (<a href=3D"http=
s://rswfire.com/library/signal/01KE0KY6HR09RFSFSEC7ZT1HAB?t=3D67" id=3D"OWA=
1c8fbc22-0ae5-dfaf-2781-afa1db02e524" class=3D"font-mono text-[0.9em] text-=
emerald-800 underline decoration-emerald-300 underline-offset-2 hover:text-=
emerald-600 OWAAutoLink" title=3D"Demonstrating the Autonomy Realms Signal =
Pipeline =B7 1:07" data-recording=3D"01KE0KY6HR09RFSFSEC7ZT1HAB" data-t=3D"=
67">1:07</a>).
 That mirror is the reason the rest of it exists (<a href=3D"https://rswfir=
e.com/library/signal/01KE0KY6HR09RFSFSEC7ZT1HAB?t=3D77" id=3D"OWAf2594a5e-3=
70d-bf5c-6dfa-2058a0a65aa6" class=3D"font-mono text-[0.9em] text-emerald-80=
0 underline decoration-emerald-300 underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-60=
0 OWAAutoLink" title=3D"Demonstrating the Autonomy Realms Signal Pipeline =
=B7 1:17" data-recording=3D"01KE0KY6HR09RFSFSEC7ZT1HAB" data-t=3D"77">1:17<=
/a>).
 Then it reads across: a hundred signals out of one stretch of time taken t=
ogether (<a href=3D"https://rswfire.com/library/signal/01KE0KY6HR09RFSFSEC7=
ZT1HAB?t=3D136" id=3D"OWA75ceac4f-3599-7199-abf7-4d5ba14e483c" class=3D"fon=
t-mono text-[0.9em] text-emerald-800 underline decoration-emerald-300 under=
