e74b7d5d5" class=3D"font-mono text-[0.9em] text-emerald-800 underline decor=
ation-emerald-300 underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-600 OWAAutoLink" ti=
tle=3D"Hiking Tahkenitch Creek Trail While Building Reflection Layers =B7 7=
