FHJCBDENX" data-t=3D"955">15:55</a>).
 On August 31 he took the Tahkenitch Creek trail out with a friend, three a=
nd a third miles, and stood at the water.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" id=3D"p264" class=
